    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "02. Datasheets",
    "ruleNumber": "02.04",
    "summary": "A ranged profile’s Range sets its reach. A profile marked Melee is a melee weapon. Attacks gives its dice count. Use BS for ranged accuracy and WS for melee accuracy. Strength informs wounding, AP modifies the save and Damage gives the attack’s damage amount. When a rule needs an absent Strength characteristic, use Strength 1 for that interaction.",
